  "content": "<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/uHWfIHb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/better-than-bunnies/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Than Bunnies</a> 的驕傲後繼者登場！時髦羊駝（Dapper Llamas）將讓您的世界變得華麗非凡！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PPQP2lV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>當然包含費斯帽和捲曲鬍鬚。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>部分模型由 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RazzleberryFox\" rel=\"nofollow\">RazzleberryFox</a> 製作，經授權使用。可單獨禁用服裝部件，羊駝的時髦度會隨機加權，創造出無數種變化！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模組僅需客戶端安裝。需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a>。Fabric 版本請至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-than-llamas-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> 下載。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Wyld/status/846489501320982528\" rel=\"nofollow\">#怪Wyld就對了</a></p>",
